---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import VideoBg from "../components/VideoBg.astro";
---

<Layout title="Superheroic">
  <Nav />
  <section class="hero superheroic">
    <div class="content__wrapper case"></div>
  </section>
  <section class="work">
    <div class="work_wrapper">
      <div class="work-title">
        <h2 class="h2">SUPERHEROIC</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="work_details">
        <ul role="list" class="list-2 work w-list-unstyled">
          <li class="list-title work">
            <div>SERVICES</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">VISUAL DESIGN</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">COPYWRITING</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">ILLUSTRATION</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">ICONOGRAPHY</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">BRANDING</div>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="work_intro">
          <p>When was the last time an apparel company reshaped the future?<br><br>Super Heroic is much more than a clothing company. It’s a mindset. By unlocking the powers of confidence and creativity, they proved that children can make a difference when they believe it. And that’s the most important kind of superpower there is.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3646-4467089f" class="w-layout-layout work_grid wf-layout-layout">
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3647-4467089f" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/super-shoe.mp4" img="/images/image-4.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/image-4-p-500.png 500w, /images/image-4-p-800.png 800w, /images/image-4-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/image-4.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3653-4467089f" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/superheroic-nasa.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/superheroic-nasa-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/superheroic-nasa-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/superheroic-nasa-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/superheroic-nasa.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd365f-4467089f" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/superheroic-billboard.mp4" img="/images/video-large.webp" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/video-large-p-500.png 500w, /images/video-large-p-800.png 800w, /images/video-large-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/video-large-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/video-large-p-2000.png 2000w, /images/video-large-p-2600.png 2600w, /images/video-large.webp 3000w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3669-4467089f" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/superheroic-card.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/superheroic-card-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/superheroic-card-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/superheroic-card-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/superheroic-card.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_4e46d753-55c9-db65-bd2c-6db41309ac57-4467089f" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/super-built.mp4" img="/images/work-1.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/work-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/work-1-p-800.png 800w, /images/work-1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/work-1.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3675-4467089f" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/super-website.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/super-website-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/super-website-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/super-website-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/super-website-p-1600.jpg 1600w, /images/super-website-p-2000.jpg 2000w, /images/super-website-p-2600.jpg 2600w, /images/super-website.webp 3000w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_94f218bf-7c86-48a2-7318-804d19e60b76-4467089f" class="w-layout-cell">
          <div class="work_text">
            <p>Our challenge was to help show children that there’s a superhero inside all of us, no matter our age, size, background, or what we look like.<br><br>We helped design interactive games, exhibition spaces, comic book characters, an inspirational playground app, and promote their apparel and competitions. Super Heroic also partnered with NASA, to show kids that not even the sky&#x27;s the limit.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_4de8a0e5-ab81-d579-9dee-b09df83eaf5c-4467089f" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/superheroci-bolt.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/superheroci-bolt-p-500.png 500w, /images/superheroci-bolt-p-800.png 800w, /images/superheroci-bolt-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/superheroci-bolt.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd36ad-4467089f" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/banner.mp4" img="/images/banner.webp" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/banner-p-500.png 500w, /images/banner-p-800.png 800w, /images/banner-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/banner-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/banner-p-2000.png 2000w, /images/banner-p-2600.png 2600w, /images/banner.webp 3000w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd36b9-4467089f" class="w-layout-cell">
          <div class="case-website container">
            <div class="web-container"><img src="/images/footwear-pdp.webp" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 68vw, (max-width: 1919px) 67vw, 750px" srcset="/images/footwear-pdp-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/footwear-pdp-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/footwear-pdp-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/footwear-pdp-p-1600.jpg 1600w, /images/footwear-pdp.webp 1728w" alt="" class="image-3"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-c919498d-959b-1740-bc47-c06d766d59dd-4467089f" class="w-layout-cell">
          <blockquote class="block-quote">&quot;JUICEBOX were instrumental in helping us establish our new company in an ultra-competitive landscape. We cherish working with them.&quot;<br></blockquote>
          <div class="block-quote name">HARSH SISODIA - CMO &amp; Co-FOUNDER</div>
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-d8eb221c-a148-e54a-a635-26d3812e4d08-4467089f" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/super-mobile.mp4" img="/images/video-large.webp" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/video-large-p-500.png 500w, /images/video-large-p-800.png 800w, /images/video-large-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/video-large-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/video-large-p-2000.png 2000w, /images/video-large-p-2600.png 2600w, /images/video-large.webp 3000w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-dc6361cc-cbc5-b8ec-26e4-3634254591a8-4467089f" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/shoe-icons_1shoe-icons.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/shoe-icons_1-p-500.png 500w, /images/shoe-icons_1-p-800.png 800w, /images/shoe-icons_1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/shoe-icons_1shoe-icons.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-f8791e45-0216-7833-f813-1604e2a885ad-4467089f" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/icons.mp4" img="/images/work-1.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/work-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/work-1-p-800.png 800w, /images/work-1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/work-1.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_2fa81216-b45a-90be-3b06-216d446307a4-4467089f" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/herolab_1herolab.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/herolab_1-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/herolab_1-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/herolab_1-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/herolab_1-p-1600.jpg 1600w, /images/herolab_1-p-2000.jpg 2000w, /images/herolab_1-p-2600.jpg 2600w, /images/herolab_1herolab.webp 3000w" alt=""></div>
      </div>
      <div id="footer-line" class="footer-trigger"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
